### Canonical routing tiers
| Tier | Model | Use when |
|------|-------|----------|
| 1 â€” cheapest | 4.5-Air (only if active route explicitly supports it; else 4.7) | Discovery Â· targeted rg Â· 
format Â· small docs Â· simple JSON/YAML Â· log summary Â· bounded mechanics with no protected-surface impact |
