### Cheapest-capable decision tree
```
Is the task discovery / format / rg / small-doc / bounded-mechanics?
  YES â†’ Tier 1 (4.5-Air if route supports; else Tier 2)
  NO â†“
Is the task ordinary coding / narrow bug / focused test / routine inspection / bounded unprotected multi-file?
  YES â†’ Tier 2 (GLM-4.7)
  NO â†“
Is GLM-5.1 explicitly confirmed on the active route AND the task is moderate debug / cross-file / concurrency / 
bounded architecture?
  YES â†’ Tier 3 (GLM-5.1)
  NO or UNSURE â†’ skip to â†“
Does the task touch: difficult architecture; protected surface 
(Bridge/trading/risk/identity/persistence/concurrency/migration/broker); adversarial safety; complex post-audit 
repair; or is an exact-model user request?
  YES â†’ Tier 4 (GLM-5.2)
  NO â†’ can Tier 2 handle with tighter scope? Tighten and use 4.7. If not, escalate with written evidence.
```
